Package: rconnectssh
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-vte-2.91, python3-cryptography, openssh-client, sshpass
Maintainer: admvvk
Homepage: https://github.com/admvvk/rConnectSSH
Description: GTK SSH connection manager
 rConnectSSH is an SSH connection manager for Linux, in the spirit of
 mRemoteNG: a docked connections tree lives in one window, with SSH
 sessions opening as tabs inside it instead of separate top-level
 windows (unlike Remmina).
 .
 SSH runs through a native VTE terminal widget (no external terminal
 emulator, no process/window discovery), with a right-click Copy/Paste
 context menu.
